<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 3.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 3.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines reported by Kuku Raadio on Tuesday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Priit Kelder, head of the local Interpol office, has agreed to become the deputy under secretary of the interior ministry.</p>
<p>- The Candian national elections have returned the Liberal Party to power.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 620 9201/2, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
